<panel id="dragon-exam-popup" class="info-popup-overlay" hidden="true">
    <panel class="dragon-exam-dialog">
        <panel class="dragon-exam-header horizontal">
            <panel class="dragon-exam-icon-well"><image sprite="Assets/Textures/GameUIAtlas.atlas#dragon-exam" /></panel>
            <panel class="dragon-exam-heading">
                <text class="info-popup-kind">ЭКЗАМЕН ДРАКОНА</text>
                <text class="dragon-exam-title">Испытание на повышение</text>
            </panel>
        </panel>
        <panel class="dragon-exam-body">
            <text id="dragon-exam-copy" class="dragon-exam-copy">Принять участие в экзамене&#10;на повышение ранга?&#10;Следующий шанс — через 4 года.</text>
            <panel class="dragon-rank-transition horizontal">
                <panel class="dragon-rank-plate"><image id="dragon-exam-current-rank" class="dragon-rank-icon" sprite="Assets/Textures/MissionRanks.atlas#f" /></panel>
                <text class="dragon-rank-arrow">&gt;</text>
                <panel class="dragon-rank-plate dragon-rank-target"><image id="dragon-exam-next-rank" class="dragon-rank-icon" sprite="Assets/Textures/MissionRanks.atlas#f-plus" /></panel>
            </panel>
            <panel class="dragon-exam-actions">
                <button id="dragon-exam-start" class="wide-action"><text id="dragon-exam-start-label">ПОВЫСИТЬ РАНГ</text></button>
                <button id="dragon-exam-later" class="wide-action secondary-wide">ПОЗЖЕ</button>
            </panel>
        </panel>
    </panel>
</panel>
